node_modules/
site/**/dist/
site/**/.astro/

# =============================================================================
# Written by the test run itself, not inputs to it: the *Output tests render documents for a
# human to open, and the templating tests build every file they then read. Tracking them meant
# every test run left the working tree dirty.
#
# Listed one by one on purpose. `**/output/` and `**/Fixtures/` also matched
# Pragmatic.Events.Tests/Fixtures and Pragmatic.Imaging.Tests/Fixtures, which hold twelve real
# tracked inputs — already in the index, so nothing broke here, but a fresh clone or a copy into
# a new repository would have dropped them without a word. A path added here has to be a
# deliberate act, and grep has to be able to find it.
# =============================================================================
Pragmatic.Documents/tests/Pragmatic.Documents.Docx.Tests/output/
Pragmatic.Documents/tests/Pragmatic.Documents.E2E.Tests/output/
Pragmatic.Documents/tests/Pragmatic.Documents.Pdf.Tests/output/
Pragmatic.Documents/tests/Pragmatic.Documents.Xlsx.Tests/output/
Pragmatic.Documents/tests/Pragmatic.Documents.Templating.Tests/Fixtures/
Pragmatic.Documents/tests/Pragmatic.Documents.Templating.Spreadsheet.Tests/Fixtures/
